-- title:
--   Base-changed deck group: fixed field and degree formula
-- statement:
--   Let $L$ be a field equipped with a $\mathbb{Q}$-algebra structure and algebraic over $\mathbb{Q}$, and let $F_0 \le F_1$ be intermediate fields of $\mathbb{Q}$ in the Laurent series field $\mathbb{Q}((q))$. Let $\Gamma$ be a finite group and $\delta \colon \Gamma \to (F_1 \simeq_{\mathbb{Q}} F_1)$ a homomorphism into the group of $\mathbb{Q}$-algebra automorphisms of $F_1$, subject to two conditions: every $\delta(g)$ fixes each $x \in F_1$ whose underlying Laurent series lies in $F_0$, and conversely every $x \in F_1$ with $\delta(g)x = x$ for all $g \in \Gamma$ has its underlying Laurent series in $F_0$. Write $L\cdot F_i$ for `laurentBaseChange L F`$_i$, the intermediate field of $L$ in $L((q))$ generated by the image of $F_i$ under the coefficientwise embedding $\mathbb{Q}((q)) \to L((q))$, let $\varphi =$ `inclusionBar L h` $\colon L\cdot F_0 \to L\cdot F_1$ be the $L$-algebra inclusion induced by $F_0 \le F_1$, and let $G$ be the image of the composite of $\delta$ with `geomAut L F₁`, the homomorphism sending $\sigma \in \operatorname{Aut}_{\mathbb{Q}}(F_1)$ to the $L$-automorphism of $L\cdot F_1$ obtained from $\mathrm{id}_L \otimes \sigma$ through the isomorphism $L \otimes_{\mathbb{Q}} F_1 \cong L\cdot F_1$. The conclusion is threefold: the field range of $\varphi$ equals the fixed field of $G$; $L\cdot F_1$ is a finite module over $L\cdot F_0$ for the algebra structure given by $\varphi$; and the rank of that module equals the cardinality of $G$.
--
--   This is an Artin-style Galois descent package for coverings of modular curves presented by subfields of $\mathbb{Q}((q))$ carrying a $\mathbb{Q}$-rational deck group: after base change to $L$ the base field is recovered as the fixed field of the base-changed deck group, and the covering is finite of degree the order of that group. It is used in the treatment of the Shimura covering and of diamond-operator sums, being cited by [`ModularCurve.JH.exists_pullback_pushforward_jOne_galois_and_comp_eq_nsmul_and_sum_diamondOneBar_eq`](thm.html#ModularCurve.JH.exists_pullback_pushforward_jOne_galois_and_comp_eq_nsmul_and_sum_diamondOneBar_eq), [`ModularCurve.exists_coprime_forall_eq_diamondAutBar_of_forall_apply_coeffEmb_modularFunctionFieldFull_eq_x1FunctionFieldBar`](thm.html#ModularCurve.exists_coprime_forall_eq_diamondAutBar_of_forall_apply_coeffEmb_modularFunctionFieldFull_eq_x1FunctionFieldBar) and [`ModularCurve.sum_diamondAutBar_smul_eq_ncard_smul_pullbackAlong_pushforwardAlong`](thm.html#ModularCurve.sum_diamondAutBar_smul_eq_ncard_smul_pullbackAlong_pushforwardAlong).
